      "question": "What is the chunk store and what data does it currently contain?",
      "ground_truth": "The chunk store is a passage store that holds raw text windows with their embeddings for cosine similarity search. It currently contains approximately 993 chunks sourced primarily from the Claude Mythos Preview System Card PDF. Each chunk stores an id, text, source filename, page number, and embedding vector.",
